            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>An embodiment comprises: a housing comprising a first to a fourth corner portion; magnets arranged on the first to the fourth corner portion, respectively; a bobbin disposed in the housing; a first coil comprising a coil, which is disposed on the bobbin and faces the magnets; a position sensor disposed between the first corner portion and the second corner portion of the housing; and a sensing magnet, which is disposed on the bobbin and faces the position sensor, wherein each of the magnets comprises a first magnet part comprising a first N pole and a first S pole; a second magnet part comprising a second N pole and a second S pole and disposed under the first magnet part; and a partition wall separating the first magnet part and the second magnet part.</p>
            </abstract>
